\q1 \rb You will cast out|וְתַשְׁלִ֛יךְ\rb* \rb all|כָּל־\rb* \rb our sins|חַטֹּאותָֽם׃\rb*
\q2 \rb into the depths|בִּמְצֻל֥וֹת\rb* \rb of the sea.|יָ֖ם\rb*
\q1 \v 20 \rb You will show|תִּתֵּ֤ן\rb* \rb faithfulness|אֱמֶת֙\rb* \rb to Jacob|לְיַֽעֲקֹ֔ב\rb*
\q2 \rb and loving devotion|חֶ֖סֶד\rb* \rb to Abraham,|לְאַבְרָהָ֑ם\rb*
\q1 \rb as|אֲשֶׁר־\rb* \rb You swore|נִשְׁבַּ֥עְתָּ\rb* \rb to our fathers|לַאֲבֹתֵ֖ינוּ\rb*
\q2 \rb from the days|מִ֥ימֵי\rb* \rb of old.|קֶֽדֶם׃\rb*
